HH (highway hierarchy) alternative routes in core-legacy, which found none:

- calcAlternativeRoute() sized its loops with sizeof(distances), a pointer
  (4 on ARM32), instead of the number of route points, and read useToSkip
  uninitialised; its arrays leaked. Now vectors of points.size().
- DataTileManager::getClosestObjects() kept a tile only when the tile's
  centre was within the radius; with zoom-11 tiles (about 12 km) and radii
  of 0.3-2 km it returned nothing, so no point was ever excluded and every
  "alternative" was the main route again. Now the distance to the tile's
  nearest edge.
- An exclusion with no route (a start's only network exit) stopped the
  search; it now tries the next point.
- runRouting() prepared detailed results for the main route only; the
  alternatives get them too.

Apply from the OsmAnd source-aggregate root after qnx-legacy-routing.patch.
Bench (Kyiv, route_bench): 1-2 alternatives per route for 1-2 s extra.

